logguard (1.0.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package validated with lintian --pedantic: maintainer scripts use deb-
    systemd-helper/deb-systemd-invoke, add logguard(8) man page, Debian-
    format changelog and Documentation key in the service.
  * Fix: the timer was not enabled on install; units now live in
    /usr/lib/systemd/system.
  * New dependency: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54).

 -- mgoreiro <mgoreiro@gmail.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 19:40:00 +0000

